      "html": "<div class=\"ds-targets\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"选择题目\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第1题\"><span>1</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"第2题\">2<span class=\"ds-dash\"></span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-targets{display:flex;gap:10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;}.ds-targets button{display:flex;flex:1;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;min-height:44px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;background:#efefe5;color:var(--muted,#656a65);font:inherit;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer;}.ds-targets button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--accent-soft,#f7e8df);color:var(--accent,#ae3e2b);border-color:#d4a18c;}.ds-targets button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#ae3e2b);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-dash{width:12px;height:2px;background:#b5b9aa;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "入口容器",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "entry-panel",
      "description": "暖白边框容器；手机改用较小圆角与内边距。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-entry\"><h2>朋友们，集合了</h2><p>输入房间号，加入这一场城市探索。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-entry{padding:32px;background:var(--surface,#fffdf8);border:1px solid var(--line,#deded3);border-radius:22px;color:var(--ink,#252c2b);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;}.ds-entry h2{margin:0;font-size:25px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.02em;}.ds-entry p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#656a65);}@media(max-width:860px){.ds-entry{padding:24px;border-radius:18px;}.ds-entry h2{font-size:22px;}.ds-entry p{font-size:12px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "个人成绩票据",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "result-summary",
      "description": "静态样式示例；演示数字不是游戏结果。真实界面首次完成结算时单次庆祝，完整动效时序见 extensions.motion，源码在 src/Results.jsx。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-result-summary\" aria-label=\"个人成绩单示例\"><svg class=\"ds-result-route\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 56\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-route-base\" d=\"M-10 40h46l25-24h65l28 25h63l30-25h88\"/><path class=\"ds-route-ink\" d=\"M-10 40h46l25-24h65l28 25h63l30-25h88\"/><circle cx=\"61\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"217\" cy=\"41\" r=\"4\"/></svg><h2 class=\"ds-result-headline\">北京，又熟悉了一点</h2><div class=\"ds-result-score-row\"><div class=\"ds-result-score\"><span>你的总误差</span><strong>2.40 km</strong></div><div class=\"ds-result-seal\"><span>北京盲猜</span><span class=\"ds-result-rank\">第 <b>2</b> 名</span><span>挑战完成</span></div></div><button class=\"ds-result-best\" aria-label=\"回看最准的一针：景山公园\"><span>最准一针<strong>景山公园</strong></span><b>320 m</b><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-result-summary{position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e7cebd; background: var(--accent-soft,#f7e8df); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 16px 0;}.ds-result-route{position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 56px; color: var(--accent,#ae3e2b); pointer-events: none; z-index: -1;}.ds-result-route path{stroke-width: 1;}.ds-route-base{stroke: #e4c5b1;}.ds-route-ink{stroke: currentColor; stroke-opacity: 0.25;}.ds-result-route circle{fill: var(--accent-soft,#f7e8df); stroke: #c77d60; stroke-width: 1.5;}.ds-result-headline{position: relative; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; background: var(--accent-soft,#f7e8df); padding-right: 8px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--accent-dark,#8f2e20); font-weight: 600;}.ds-result-score-row{display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 70px; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin: 17px 0 19px;}.ds-result-score > span{display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #814638;}.ds-result-score > strong{display: block; font-size: clamp(23px, 6.7vw, 30px); line-height: 1.3; color: var(--accent-dark,#8f2e20); letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin-top: 5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; overflow-wrap: anywhere;}.ds-result-seal{display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 70px; min-height: 75px; padding: 5px 0; border: 3px double var(--accent,#ae3e2b); border-radius: 9px; color: var(--accent-dark,#8f2e20); transform: rotate(-7deg);}.ds-result-seal > span:not(.ds-result-rank){font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;}.ds-result-rank{font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.3; white-space: nowrap;}.ds-result-rank b{font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700;}.ds-result-best{position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-height: 56px; width: 100%; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px dashed #c99e82; color: var(--accent-dark,#8f2e20); background: transparent; text-align: left;}.ds-result-best > span{flex: 1; min-width: 0; font-size: 10px;}.ds-result-best strong{display: block; font-size: 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere;}.ds-result-best b{font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;}.ds-result-best:hover{color: var(--ink,#252c2b);}.ds-result-summary{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;}.ds-result-headline{margin:0;}.ds-result-best{border-right:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;cursor:pointer;}.ds-result-best:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#ae3e2b);outline-offset:3px;}"
